{"version":1,"content":"<p>微軟CEO公開回應全球服務中斷事故。當地時間11月17日，微軟CEO薩提亞·納德拉（Satya Nadella）在Ignite年度技術大會上回應了上周發生的全球性服務中斷事件，承認微軟在提升服務韌性方面仍有工作要做，並承諾持續吸取教訓、改進系統可靠性。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586924.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T07:17:26.006622+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":131,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T07:07:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T07:10:40.321844+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T07:10:40.321844+00:00","content_hash":"7cb6f275a78abd17962509cd1e0986164a5ae150748f91348b7008ba53367494","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}